{"id":339,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"世界に貢献する人を育てる札幌日大","feature_description":"札幌日本大学中学校・高等学校は、進路実現だけでなく『世界に貢献する人』の育成を掲げる学校です。中高一貫の流れの中で、グローバルに活躍できる力や自ら行動する姿勢を育てます。部活動ページも公式で整い、文武両道の姿勢が見えます。公式サイトの学校案内や教育ページが整理され、学びの方針と学校生活の両面を確認しやすいです。 公式サイトの学校生活や行事の導線も整っており、比較用に必要な情報を確認しやすいです。入学後の姿も想像しやすいです。","clubs":[{"id":6252,"name":"軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sapporonichidai.ed.jp/junior/specialty/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6253,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sapporonichidai.ed.jp/junior/specialty/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6254,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sapporonichidai.ed.jp/junior/specialty/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6255,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sapporonichidai.ed.jp/junior/specialty/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6256,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sapporonichidai.ed.jp/junior/specialty/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6257,"name":"ボランティア部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.sapporonichidai.ed.jp/junior/specialty/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6258,"name":"囲碁将棋部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.sapporonichidai.ed.jp/junior/specialty/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6259,"name":"科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.sapporonichidai.ed.jp/junior/specialty/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6260,"name":"ロボット部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.sapporonichidai.ed.jp/junior/specialty/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6261,"name":"芸術同好会・美術部","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url":"https://www.sapporonichidai.ed.jp/junior/specialty/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6262,"name":"ダンス同好会","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url":"https://www.sapporonichidai.ed.jp/junior/specialty/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6263,"name":"英会話同好会","category":"同好会・愛好会","source